  "note": "Reserves before the swap come from meta.preTokenBalances, which the transaction carries, so no archival access is needed. A residual here is the model disagreeing with the CHAIN rather than with another copy of this system. Only DIRECT single-hop swaps whose taker-side quantity could be isolated count toward the headline; the rest are kept with their numbers and excluded.",
